>> Enter the BM and quaff a blessed potion of object detection.
> What the use ?

When you have blessed object detected a level, you know what every
object on the level is.  Using the '/' or ';' command will tell you
what rings/scrolls/potions/wands/amulets are from a distance without
having to walk onto that square.  This lets you collect the valuable
stuff without visiting the squares with useless junk.

There are several ways to acquire pets while in the BM.  They include
figurines, tossing food to the 'domesticatable' monsters. 'Turn undead'
of a dead former pet.  Stone-to-flesh of a stoned former pet.  Eggs you
laid yourself.  Eggs laid by others. #monster as a lycanthrope.  You
cannot bring pets into or out of the BM unless you invoke the wizard's
quest artifact.



